sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Sender
    participant N as Network
    participant B as Receiver
    A->>N: seq=1, payload P1
    N-->>B: datagram 1 ok
    B-->>A: ACK seq=2
    A->>N: seq=2, payload P2
    N--xB: datagram 2 lost
    Note over A: timeout T<br/>no ACK for seq=2
    A->>N: seq=2 retransmit
    N-->>B: datagram 2 ok
    B-->>A: ACK seq=3
    A->>N: seq=3, payload P3
    N-->>B: datagram 3 ok
    Note over B: P2 arrives sau P3<br/>jitter buffer reorder by seq
    B-->>A: ACK seq=4
